00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:48.230
Tarou, um...

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:50.190
Let's go to the zoo!

00:10:51.270 --> 00:10:53.520
Okay? Why don't we go to the zoo?

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:55.520
