00:12:08.180 --> 00:12:09.350
I see.

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:12.850
Yuuno-san,

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:15.730
this gives me a lot of courage.

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:17.480
Tarou.

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:19.320
