00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:40.770
Tarou!

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:52.530
<b>memory back...<i>!?</i></b>

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:57.660
Th-That was surprising...

00:13:57.660 --> 00:13:59.920
